          "source": "@laurogeitabat",
          "title": "X repost from @laurogeitabat: Today, I made a comment on @CanalplusF1 regarding Zak Brown’s comments about Oscar Piastri duri…",
          "title_zh": "X 转帖 @laurogeitabat：今天，我在 @CanalplusF1 上就 Zak Brown 昨天在 @F1 TV 采访中关于 Oscar Piastri 的言论发表了评论，我当时也在场。我完全误解了他的话，为此道歉。我知道对 Zak 和整个 McLaren 车队来说，尊重他们的车手、公平平等地对待他们有多重要。McLaren 今天拥有最快的赛车，只是在 VSC 上运气不好。我相信 Lando 和 Oscar 在 Baku 都会再次有机会争夺胜利。",
          "summary": "Today, I made a comment on @CanalplusF1 regarding Zak Brown’s comments about Oscar Piastri during an interview yesterday on @F1 TV, which I was part of. I completely misunderstood his words and want to apologise for that. I know how important it is to Zak and the entire McLaren team to respect their drivers and treat them fairly and equally. McLaren had the fastest car today and were unlucky with the VSC. I’m sure both Lando and Oscar will have another chance to fight for the win in Baku.",
          "summary_zh": "今天，我在 @CanalplusF1 上就 Zak Brown 昨天在 @F1 TV 采访中关于 Oscar Piastri 的言论发表了评论，我当时也在场。我完全误解了他的话，为此道歉。我知道对 Zak 和整个 McLaren 车队来说，尊重他们的车手、公平平等地对待他们有多重要。McLaren 今天拥有最快的赛车，只是在 VSC 上运气不好。我相信 Lando 和 Oscar 在 Baku 都会再次有机会争夺胜利。",
